### Gateway-native endpoints (handled by ti-gateway-api itself, not proxied to a backend)

### Version
GET http://localhost:8080/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

###

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Current OIDC ID token — requires an authenticated browser session (see docker/README section in README.md)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/token
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION=<SESSION_COOKIE_VALUE>

###

### Logout (redirects to Okta logout, then back to the dashboard SPA)
GET http://localhost:8080/logout

###
